# --- M7-03 storage blocks ---
# Crates: Block::new with ofFullCopy(OAK_PLANKS).strength(2.0, 3.0).sound(WOOD); the oak-planks template brings
# the rest. FD registers no flammability for them (ofFullCopy does not copy FireBlock odds): a NotFlammable part
# (src/blocks/storage.rs). The three vanilla-crop crates' recipes carry the vanilla_crates_enabled condition.

