template = "minecraft:hay_block"

# --- M7-04 baskets ---
# Template minecraft:oak_planks: a plain full block (BasketBlock is a BaseEntityBlock with no vanilla behaviour of
# its own); its fire odds are dropped in code (FD registers none). Declared: 6-way `facing` (placed opposite the
# nearest looking direction, in code), `enabled` (cleared by a redstone signal, flag 4 as FD), `waterlogged`.
# Outline and collision: the hollow cube open toward `facing`; interaction: the full cube; occludes nothing
# (FD's occlusion shape is the 1..15 inner box). Block entity (27 slots, generic_9x3 menu, pulls item entities):
# src/blocks/basket.rs. The `farmersdelight:basket` alias of the bamboo basket is not reproduced (accepted delta).

